Subject: [PATCH] fix(v2): preserve location identities and fence failed
 indexing

---
 chronik/chronik-http/src/v2_explorer.rs | 12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chronik/chronik-http/src/v2_explorer.rs b/chronik/chronik-http/src/v2_explorer.rs
index 6a490ae08fcd52c3066e2b09538a5d73e1e99587..e969e6708a1633956ee434b03e99b4184be230e4 100644
--- a/chronik/chronik-http/src/v2_explorer.rs
